    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 484498d33d4366c448e61c16477fddd8, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Hey, dude. Watch it!
    - 'I could say the same to you. '
    - I thought I was the only person here.
    - You thought wrong.
    - "Sorry, that was rude of me. My name is Rufio. \nI\u2019m\u2026 glad I\u2019m
      not the only person here."
    - "Lucas. Nice to meet you. Any idea why we\u2019re here?"
    - Nope, not yet. But it appears our paths diverge here. Be safe.
    - See you on the other side, man.
  vcam: {fileID: 0}
  spokeWith: 0
